## Authority of This Record

For purposes of `ADDITIONAL-PERMISSIONS`, this file constitutes the official record of current Esteemed Author designations.

Only an authorized decision of the CleatsPL organization may add or remove an individual from the current **Esteemed Authors** section.

Changes to this file do not alter copyright ownership or any rights independently held by an individual under applicable law or license.
